<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal construction sector doing well - INE.</title>
<headline>Portugal construction sector doing well - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The prospects for Portugal's construction sector are clearly positive in the first quarter of 1997, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>&quot;The prospects...are clearly positive...(with) the number of assured months of work at a high level, the same as in the last quarter,&quot; it said in its latest survey of businessmen.</p>
<p>Neverthless, businessmen still saw little immediate chances of price rises even if prospects were improving.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
